note omegese-om2.md 2 lines 59-62 (both profiles): a group holding two values for one operand.
note The OM-1 code and line are pinned by the pinned compiler; the OM-2 unit keeps the same code, its line one later.
om2
fn main to int
x = int 5
ret add (x 2) 2
end
